  "checks": [
    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.GaussianIBP.hasDerivAt_stdPDF: no direct label",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "GaussianIBP.lean:60-61 has only 'x : ℝ' and proves 'HasDerivAt ... (-x * gaussianPDFReal 0 1 x) x', matching ledger:868 and claims.yaml:3115. TeX integrated_compact_gaussian.tex:117-120 invokes Gaussian-density integration by parts but does not state this density derivative separately; the foundation/no-direct-label designation is appropriate."
