    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.GaussianIBP.integral_coord_mul_eq_of_growth: P:finite-gaussian-matrix",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "GaussianIBP.lean:227-233 assumes slice differentiability, a.e. strong measurability, and polynomial-growth bounds for both f and f′; it concludes both integrabilities and the IBP identity. TeX integrated_compact_gaussian.tex:116-120 takes f=P polynomial, automatically meeting these conditions. Ledger:880 and claims.yaml:3199 describe this faithful generalized foundation, not an unproved supplied input."
