    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.GaussianIBP.integrable_pow_gaussian: R:gaussian-one-variance-test",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "GaussianIBP.lean:241-245 takes 'j : ℕ' and proves 'Integrable (fun x : ℝ => x ^ j) (gaussianReal 0 1)'. TeX integrated_compact_gaussian.tex:177 uses the finite second and fourth moments, with general polynomial finiteness established at :116-117. Ledger:881 and claims.yaml:3206 accurately state the harmless all-powers extension."
