    },
    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.GaussianIBP.integral_comp_eq_stdPi: no direct label",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "GaussianIBP.lean:284-291 assumes independence, standard marginal laws, and 'AEStronglyMeasurable h (stdPi N)', concluding equality of expectations under the original and canonical laws. Ledger:886 and claims.yaml:3241 match. TeX integrated_compact_gaussian.tex:94,117-120 works directly with the product density rather than stating a separate transfer theorem; auxiliary classification is honest."
