      "reason": "GaussianIBP.lean:294-301 assumes 'iIndepFun', standard 'HasLaw', and a.e. strong measurability of h, and proves the integrability equivalence. Ledger:887 and claims.yaml:3248 reproduce those conditions. TeX integrated_compact_gaussian.tex:94,116-120 uses the same Gaussian law implicitly but has no separate integrability-transfer assertion."
