    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.GaussianIBP.integral_coord_mul_eq_of_growth_paper: P:finite-gaussian-matrix",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "GaussianIBP.lean:306-315 assumes independent standard Gaussian laws, continuous f,f′, their growth bounds, and the slice derivative identity. TeX integrated_compact_gaussian.tex:116-120 uses polynomials, satisfying all these conditions, and gives the same IBP identity. Ledger:888 and claims.yaml:3255 accurately state this generalized wrapper; it introduces no extra final-result hypothesis."
