    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.FiniteGaussianMatrix.conj_trace: no direct label",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "FiniteGaussianMatrix.lean:84-86 assumes 'U : unitaryGroup n ℂ' and arbitrary square X, proving 'trace (U * X * star U) = trace X'. Ledger:889 and claims.yaml:3263 agree. TeX integrated_compact_gaussian.tex:63-88 changes eigenbases but does not state this separate trace-bookkeeping lemma; auxiliary mapping is appropriate."
