      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "FiniteGaussianMatrix.lean:157-158 assumes Hermitian Y,B and concludes 'eigWeight hY B i j = eigWeight hY B j i'. TeX integrated_compact_gaussian.tex:64-65,71 uses 'b_ji = conjugate b_ij' and '|b_ij| = |b_ji|'. Ledger:898 and claims.yaml:3326 correctly express the squared-weight consequence with the same matrix hypotheses."
