      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "FiniteGaussianMatrix.lean:166-168 requires Hermitian B,Y and natural q,r and gives the real double sum cast to ℂ. TeX integrated_compact_gaussian.tex:63-68 has the same formula at 'r = L-q'. Ledger:899 and claims.yaml:3333 explicitly disclose the harmless independent-exponent generalization and the reality assertion."
