    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.FiniteGaussianMatrix.trace_word_le: L:gaussian-trace-bounds",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "FiniteGaussianMatrix.lean:201-203 assumes Hermitian B,Y, 'Even L', and 'q ≤ L'. TeX integrated_compact_gaussian.tex:48-52 has 'm ≥ 2', 'L=2m-2', and '0 ≤ q ≤ L'. Ledger:901 and claims.yaml:3347 explicitly use the stronger all-even-L core form; :348-352 identifies Y^L with |Y|^L. No constant changes."
