      "reason": "FiniteGaussianMatrix.lean:409-412 assumes a real normed algebra and natural k and gives the ordered sum of k differentiated factors. TeX integrated_compact_gaussian.tex:123-127 says 'differentiate the 2m-1 factors in their order'. Ledger:908 and claims.yaml:3396 explicitly disclose the harmless normed-algebra and arbitrary-k generalization."
